    {
      "uid": "83f6b87d-dcde-4d65-b227-6be1d9352499",
      "id": 25,
      "name": "Klopný obvod RS z NAND",
      "category": "sequential",
      "description": "Dvě hradla NAND se zpětnou vazbou, vstupy aktivní v nule (Sn, Rn). Sn = 0 nastaví Q = 1, Rn = 0 nuluje, Sn = Rn = 1 pamatuje; Sn = Rn = 0 je zakázaný stav (Q = Qn = 1). Pozor: po zapnutí jsou přepínače v 0, tedy v zakázaném stavu – nejdřív dejte do 1 jen jeden ze vstupů.",
      "translations": {
        "en": {
          "name": "RS flip-flop from NAND",
          "description": "Two NAND gates with feedback, inputs active low (Sn, Rn). Sn = 0 sets Q = 1, Rn = 0 resets, Sn = Rn = 1 holds; Sn = Rn = 0 is the forbidden state (Q = Qn = 1). Note: after power-up the switches are at 0, i.e. in the forbidden state – first set only one of the inputs to 1."
        }
      },
      "author": "Mgr. Stanislav Jan Fidrmuc",
      "license": "CC BY 4.0",
      "version": 1,
      "created": "2026-11-22",
