    {
      "uid": "2a3b8a37-7bc1-4791-b5ab-ecc06259fc29",
      "id": 29,
      "name": "Synchronní čítač modulo 10 (BCD)",
      "category": "sequential",
      "description": "Dekadický čítač 0–9 z klopných obvodů JK: po 9 (1001) následuje 0. J1 = Q0·¬Q3, K1 = Q0, J2 = K2 = Q0·Q1, J3 = Q0·Q1·Q2, K3 = Q0. Úloha 7.14 (čítač modulo N); stejnou funkci má 7490.",
      "translations": {
        "en": {
          "name": "Synchronous mod-10 (BCD) counter",
          "description": "Decade counter 0–9 from JK flip-flops: 9 (1001) is followed by 0. J1 = Q0·¬Q3, K1 = Q0, J2 = K2 = Q0·Q1, J3 = Q0·Q1·Q2, K3 = Q0. Task 7.14 (mod-N counter); the 7490 has the same function."
        }
      },
